Subject: installer_hard-dereference-tar-gz — add --hard-dereference after ownership arguments

Alpine aports refreshes this patch when dotnet TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs gains
NormalizeSourceBuildOwnership arguments. The stable-branch hunk targets the old one-line
GetDestinationArchive() helper; dotnet v8.0.133 needs --hard-dereference appended after
the ownership prefix instead.

Origin: vendor, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alpinelinux/aports/be9b54917cd3038d74590e287a68182b1e0c72ac/community/dotnet8-runtime/installer_hard-dereference-tar-gz.patch
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet.git 7d1bf90885cff22e7da72b27e9848e42fd3cb1ae
Drop-When: dependency aports/community/dotnet8-runtime >= 8.0.33

diff --git a/src/installer/src/core-sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs.orig b/src/installer/src/core-sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs
index 146055b..167327f 100644
--- a/src/installer/src/core-sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs.orig
+++ b/src/installer/src/core-sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs
@@ -140,7 +140,7 @@ private string GetDestinationArchive()
                 ? "--numeric-owner --owner=2001 --group=2001 "
                 : string.Empty;
 
-            return $"{ownershipArguments}-czf {DestinationArchive}";
+            return $"{ownershipArguments}--hard-dereference -czf {DestinationArchive}";
         }
 
         private string GetExcludes()
